{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Troubles at Home", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Not so Funny Anymore", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 8, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 1, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Relate information about common solutions to problems in spoken and written documents.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "PlaceholderWrites effective texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Writes effective texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Writes effective texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Writes effective texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Writes effective texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Writes effective texts in English showing good organization and appropriate use of language to create the intended effect for the purpose and context. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Need</span> + Passive Infinitive and <span class=\"italic\">Need</span> + Verb + -ing", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the passive infinitive to express something that is necessary. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "It can be used in affirmative, negative and interrogative sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The structure <span class=\"italic\">need + verb(ing)</span> means the same thing as a passive infinitive.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Need</span> + verb -ing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Passive Infinitive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> The pipes need fixing.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> The pipes need to be fixed.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> The carpet needs removing.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> The carpet needs to be removed.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> The hardwood floors need drying.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The hardwood floors need to be dried.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "That problem needs to be solved immediately!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The walls need to be opened in the shower to work out how the water is escaping. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Causative <span class=\"italic\">Get</span> and <span class=\"italic\">Have</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use a causative verb to express an action that someone did for you or instead of you, or someone did for another person. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "It is called a causative verb because the subject of the sentence causes the action, but is not responsible for doing it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br/><span class=\"strong\">To have someone do something </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the form:<br/> subject + <span class=\"italic\">have</span> + person + infinitive", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Here is an example:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"> I had my apprentice bring the industrial heater. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br/><span class=\"strong\">To get someone to do something</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the form:<br/><span class=\"italic\">get</span> + someone + <span class=\"italic\">to</span> + infinitive", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Here is an example:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">The plumber gets his workers to complete the projects.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I'll also have him bring our industrial heater.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'll get my apprentice to leave another job and come help.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to gush", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to flow out suddenly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Suddenly, water started gushing through the light fixture and onto the wood  and carpet. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you are talking/writing about household problems.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "fixture", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something attached permanently, usually to a wall. ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Suddenly, water started gushing through the light fixture and onto the wood  and carpet. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "deluge", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a great flood of water", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The deluge has stained the carpet and bowed the wood.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to bow", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to bend or curve", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The deluge has stained the carpet and bowed the wood.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "grout", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a coat of plaster for finishing a ceiling or interior wall", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There may be a problem with the grout.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "industrial", "type": "name"}, {"content": "relating to industry", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll also have him bring our industrial heater.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le01ob08aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Find a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 5 questions to ask them about house repairs they had done. ( \u2018What have you got someone to do in your house?', who, why, etc.)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Interview your friend using the questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down their answers.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write about household repairs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask about household repairs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write answers about household repairs.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn9le01ob08re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn9le01ob08re2img05.jpg", "time": "20", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks for coming on such short notice.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Plumber</span>: You did sound a little panicked on the phone. You said something about a leak?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: More like flood, actually. Last night, while my friend Vanessa was in the kitchen preparing dinner for us, I was taking a shower upstairs. Suddenly, water started gushing through the light fixture and onto the wood  and carpet. This needs to be fixed immediately!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Plumber</span>: Let's take a look. Yep, it looks as though the water is coming through the hole in the ceiling.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Look at the floor. The deluge has stained the carpet and bowed the wood."}, {"image": "engenn9le01ob08re2img01.jpg", "time": "33000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Plumber</span>: Do you need to use that bathroom upstairs for 24 hours? The walls need to be opened in the shower to work out how the water is escaping. There may be a problem with the grout.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Really? I have some friends coming from out of town tomorrow morning.  The bathroom needs to be ready to use before they arrive.  24 hours would have been fine otherwise.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Plumber</span>: I'll have an electrician come and look at the wiring. Let me make a call. I'll also get my apprentice to leave another job and help."}, {"image": "engenn9le01ob08re2img02.jpg", "time": "62000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hopefully that does the trick.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Plumber</span>:  These hardwood floors need to be dried out as well.  I'll also have him bring our industrial heater.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That would be great!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Plumber</span>: Before he arrives though, you will need to move all of the furniture away from the flooded area. Hopefully, this area might not need recarpeting.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That would be great.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Plumber</span>: Alright, I need to run to my truck to grab my tools.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I really appreciate it."}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le01ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le01ob08re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "video", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "time": "7000", "id": 0, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\"> When do you use the passive infinitive?</span>"}, {"image": "", "time": "29000", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">What are the different forms of the passive infinitive?</span>"}], "video_src": "engenn9le01ob08re3vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can write about household problems.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can write about things that need to be done.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about solving problems.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Have you or a family member ever dealt with leaky pipes? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Where was the water coming from? How was it repaired?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], 